IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAY0005.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY PAY0005C.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 DUES-AMT           PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM 3000-UNION-DUES
    DISPLAY "DUES-AMT=" DUES-AMT
    STOP RUN.
3000-UNION-DUES.
    IF UNION-FLG = 'Y'
        *> HIGHER UNION DUES
        IF GRS-PAY-AMT >= 4000
            MOVE 55 TO DUES-AMT
        ELSE
            MOVE 30 TO DUES-AMT
        END-IF
    ELSE
        MOVE 0 TO DUES-AMT
    END-IF.
